@startuml
title Strategy: очерёдность расформирования состава (вариант 7)

interface DismantlingOrderStrategy {
  +order(cars) : List<String>
  +title() : String
}

class DismantlingPlan {
  +makeOrder(cars, strategy) : List<String>
}

class ByDestinationOrder
class ByWeightOrder
class ByCarTypeOrder

class TrainCar {
  -number : String
  -destination : String
  -weightTons : int
  -carType : String
  -priority : boolean
}

DismantlingPlan o--> DismantlingOrderStrategy : использует
DismantlingOrderStrategy <|.. ByDestinationOrder
DismantlingOrderStrategy <|.. ByWeightOrder
DismantlingOrderStrategy <|.. ByCarTypeOrder
DismantlingPlan ..> TrainCar : упорядочивает
@enduml